{
  "workspace": "mageos",
  "root": "testdata/mageos",
  "description": "Mage-OS with the Luma sample data (Magento 2 reference app): a real Composer project of ~55k PHP files, Magento under vendor/mage-os/module-* and vendor/mage-os/framework, no generated/ code; fetched with `make reference-apps`",
  "readyProbe": "wsym.index-complete",
  "waitForIndex": true,
  "comment": "All Magento code lives in vendor/, so `vendor` here marks a target in another Composer package than the file being edited (a module into the framework, another module, or Laminas), and `cross-file` a target in another file of the same package. Cases tagged magento, di-xml, factory, proxy, layout or framework-depth need Magento knowledge (generated classes, di.xml, layout XML, ObjectManager); the rest ask plain PHP questions of Magento code. Each anchor occurs once in its file unless `occurrence` is given.",
  "openFiles": [
    "vendor/mage-os/module-catalog/Controller/Product/View.php",
    "vendor/mage-os/module-checkout/Controller/Cart/Add.php",
    "vendor/mage-os/module-catalog/view/frontend/templates/product/list.phtml",
    "vendor/mage-os/module-ai-base/src/Model/AiServiceSelector.php",
    "vendor/mage-os/module-catalog-sample-data/Model/Product.php"
  ],
