      "query": "InstallWishlistSampleData",
      "comment": "Tusk PHP resolves classes lazily through the Composer class loader, so a definition probe passes in ~0.2 s, long before the index is built, and every reference, implementation and workspace-symbol case after it would then run against a half-built index. This probe waits for the index instead.",
      "expect": {
        "items": [
